'~dup Function DIVZ(Z()AS DOUBLE ) AS DOUBLE      ' повтор, первое: Math.inc(181)
'~dup     re1 = Z(0): im1 = Z(1) : re2 = Z(2) : im2 = Z(3)
'~dup     Z(0) = (req * re2 + im1 * im2) / (re2*re2 + im2*im2)
'~dup     Z(1) = (-re1 * im2 + re2 * im1) / (re2 * re2 + im2 * im2)
'~dup     Z(2) = 0
'~dup     Z(3) = 0 
