'~dup End Function
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
'   ODD() returns "1" (=true) if a number(INTEGER) is odd
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
'~dup Function ODD(value AS INTEGER ) AS INTEGER   ' повтор, первое: rapidq.inc(700)
