'~dup       ODD = 1
'~dup     ELSE  
'~dup       ODD = 0 
'~dup    END IF 
'~dup End Function
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
'   POLZ() returns Z IN the polar coordinate system
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
' Transformation from    z = x + iy     to     z = r*cos((phi) + r*i*sin(phi)
'~dup Function POLZ(Z()AS DOUBLE ) AS DOUBLE   ' повтор, первое: Math.inc(348)
'~dup     re = Z(0): im = Z(1) 
'~dup     Z(0) = SQR( re * re + im * im) * COS(ATAN (im / re))   
'~dup     Z(1) = SQR( re * re + im * im) * SIN(ATAN (im / re))    
'~dup     POLZ = Z()                        
'~dup End Function
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
'    POWZ() returns the power n  of a complex number = (x+iy)^n = z^n
'--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
'~dup  Function POWZ(Z()AS DOUBLE ) AS DOUBLE   ' повтор, первое: Math.inc(357)
'~dup     re = Z(0): im = Z(1) : expo = Z(2) 
'~dup      Z(0) =(SQR( re * re + im * im)) ^ expo * COS(expo * ATAN (im / re) )     
'~dup      Z(1) =(SQR( re * re + im * im)) ^ expo * SIN(expo * ATAN (im / re) )
'~dup      Z(2) = 0                
'~dup     POWZ = Z()                           
'~dup End Function
